      {
        "Id": "f66a6a43da9e4d44a524172c7600f521",
        "Title": "Important:\r\nFollowing parameters must exist in the Revit file:\r\n\r\n'Fanger Method' -> using Fangers method. Fieldformat: HVAC airflow (l/s).\r\n\r\n'NKB Method' -> Nordic Committee on Building Regulations. Fieldformat: HVAC airflow (l/s).\r\n\r\n'PD' -> Perceived air quality percentage dissatisfied. Fieldformat: Number.",
